      "sentence_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3924614"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12076820,
      "language": "eng",
      "text": "From now on, please call me Tom.",
      "owner": "CK",
      "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR",
      "is_unapproved": false,
      "api_url": "https://api.tatoeba.org/v1/sentences/12076820?showtrans=none",
      "sentence_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/12076820"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12070279,
      "language": "eng",
      "text": "From now on, please don't speak to me in English. All right?",
      "owner": "sundown",
      "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR",
      "is_unapproved": false,
      "api_url": "https://api.tatoeba.org/v1/sentences/12070279?showtrans=none",
      "sentence_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/12070279"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13223930,
      "language": "eng",
      "text": "Please call me Hanako from now on.",
      "owner": "Lumi",
      "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR",
      "is_unapproved": false,
      "api_url": "https://api.tatoeba.org/v1/sentences/13223930?showtrans=none",
      "sentence_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/13223930"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11924316,
      "language": "jpn",
      "text": "これからは「トム」って呼んでくれよ。",
      "owner": "bunbuku",
      "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR",
      "is_unapproved": false,
      "api_url": "https://api.tatoeba.org/v1/sentences/11924316?showtrans=none",
      "sentence_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/11924316"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 992917,
      "language": "jpn",
      "text": "これからはもっと気を付けてね。",
      "owner": "mookeee",
      "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR",
      "is_unapproved": false,
      "api_url": "https://api.tatoeba.org/v1/sentences/992917?showtrans=none",
      "sentence_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/992917"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9938205,
      "language": "jpn",
      "text": "これからは、もっと倹約しなさいよ。",
      "owner": "bunbuku",
      "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR",
      "is_unapproved": false,
      "api_url": "https://api.tatoeba.org/v1/sentences/9938205?showtrans=none",
      "sentence_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/9938205"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 838425,
      "language": "cmn",
      "text": "請你以後不要在我面前說英文了，OK?",
      "owner": "Martha",
      "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR",
      "is_unapproved": false,
      "api_url": "https://api.tatoeba.org/v1/sentences/838425?showtrans=none",
      "sentence_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/838425"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13968330,
      "language": "cmn",
      "text": "下次别再这么干了。",
      "owner": "jan_OkulaJu",
      "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR",
      "is_unapproved": false,
      "api_url": "https://api.tatoeba.org/v1/sentences/13968330?showtrans=none",
      "sentence_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/13968330"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12371832,
      "language": "eng",
      "text": "Don't insist. When I say no, it means no.",
      "owner": "Miktsoanit",
      "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR",
      "is_unapproved": false,
      "api_url": "https://api.tatoeba.org/v1/sentences/12371832?showtrans=none",
      "sentence_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/12371832"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 2426692,
      "language": "eng",
      "text": "When I say that this spider is harmless, I don't mean that you can catch it with your hands and handle it as you like. Big spiders don't attack people unless they are provoked, and they should not be taken for toys.",
      "owner": "Amastan",
      "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR",
      "is_unapproved": false,
      "api_url": "https://api.tatoeba.org/v1/sentences/2426692?showtrans=none",
      "sentence_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2426692"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11596055,
      "language": "eng",
      "text": "\"What do you do?\" \"I'm a househusband.\" \"No, I mean for work.\" \"It is my work.\"",
      "owner": "Cabo",
      "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR",
      "is_unapproved": false,
      "api_url": "https://api.tatoeba.org/v1/sentences/11596055?showtrans=none",
      "sentence_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/11596055"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11570970,
      "language": "eng",
      "text": "\"Your grandad – he's a one, eh?\" \"What do you mean?\" \"Oh, I mean, he's a character. You know, a one-off.\" \"Ah. Yeah, he is. They broke the mould when they made him, that's for sure.\"",
      "owner": "sundown",
      "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR",
      "is_unapproved": false,
      "api_url": "https://api.tatoeba.org/v1/sentences/11570970?showtrans=none",
      "sentence_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/11570970"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9714758,
      "language": "eng",
      "text": "\"Yanni is an orphan.\" \"What do you mean?\" \"I mean his mom and dad are in heaven.\"",
      "owner": "Amastan",
      "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR",
      "is_unapproved": false,
      "api_url": "https://api.tatoeba.org/v1/sentences/9714758?showtrans=none",
      "sentence_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/9714758"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12927409,
      "language": "eng",
      "text": "\"I'm not sure what time is.\" \"You mean what time it is?\" \"No, I mean, what's time? Who knows?\"",
      "owner": "rul",
      "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR",
      "is_unapproved": false,
      "api_url": "https://api.tatoeba.org/v1/sentences/12927409?showtrans=none",
      "sentence_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/12927409"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6359798,
      "language": "eng",
      "text": "Most people, if you describe a train of events to them, will tell you what the result would be. They can put those events together in their minds, and argue from them that something will come to pass. There are few people, however, who, if you told them a result, would be able to evolve from their own inner consciousness what the steps were which led up to that result. This power is what I mean when I talk of reasoning backwards, or analytically.",
      "owner": "Hybrid",
      "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR",
      "is_unapproved": false,
      "api_url": "https://api.tatoeba.org/v1/sentences/6359798?showtrans=none",
      "sentence_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/6359798"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 153637,
      "language": "jpn",
      "text": "私は彼を右寄りだと言ったが、それは彼は頭が古いという意味で言ったのだ。",
      "owner": null,
      "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR",
      "is_unapproved": false,
      "api_url": "https://api.tatoeba.org/v1/sentences/153637?showtrans=none",
      "sentence_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/153637"
    },
    {
